<title>NETHERLANDS: ROOD TESTHOUSE SAID WILL MAKE LOSS 2ND HALF 1996.</title>
<headline>ROOD TESTHOUSE SAID WILL MAKE LOSS 2ND HALF 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rood Testhouse International NV said on Friday it was expected to aannounce a loss in the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>During the first six months of 1996 the firm posted net profit of 0.78 million guilders.</p>
<p>Rood Testhouse said the pressure on profit margins had not ended.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +20 504 5000</p>
</text>
